---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Navbar } from '../components/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { ArrowRight, Target, Zap } from 'lucide-react';

---

<Layout title="Consulenza - GinnyTech" description="Consulenza diretta in Data Analytics e Marketing Engineering. Soluzioni rapide, competenza interna e risultati riproducibili. Prenota una call gratuita.">
  <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <Navbar client:idle />

    <main id="main-content" class="relative flex-1 bg-[#050505] overflow-hidden selection:bg-neon-mint/30 selection:text-white">
    {/* Background Effects */}
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[50vh] bg-gradient-to-b from-mint-900/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[-10%] right-[-5%] w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-neon-blue/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] left-[-5%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-neon-purple/5 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-20 relative z-10">
      {/* Hero Consulenza */}
      <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-20">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-neon-mint text-xs font-mono font-medium tracking-wider mb-8 backdrop-blur-sm animate-fade-in-up">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neon-mint animate-pulse"></span>
          SOLUZIONI SU MISURA
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 font-heading drop-shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]">
          Soluzioni rapide con un <br/>
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-mint-300 to-mint-500 drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,255,163,0.4)]">
            analista esperto
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 mb-10 leading-relaxed font-sans max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Affronta le tue sfide di business con il supporto diretto. 
          Risultati riproducibili, più veloce ed economico di un'agenzia.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center">
            <a href="https://tidycal.com/andrii-d/15-minute-meeting" class="px-8 py-4 bg-mint-500 hover:bg-mint-400 text-white font-bold rounded-full transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,255,163,0.4)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,255,163,0.6)] hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-2 font-ui focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-mint-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#050505]">
                Prenota una Call
                <ArrowRight className="w-5 h-5" />
            </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Vantaggi */}
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-24">
        <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-mint-500/50 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,255,163,0.15)] backdrop-blur-sm group">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-mint-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-mint-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <Target className="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 font-heading group-hover:text-mint-400 transition-colors">Competenza Interna</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Risolviamo il problema insieme al tuo team. Non solo ottieni un risultato, ma il tuo team impara come è stato raggiunto, mantenendo il know-how in azienda.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-mint-500/50 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,255,163,0.15)] backdrop-blur-sm group">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-mint-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-mint-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <Zap className="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 font-heading group-hover:text-mint-400 transition-colors">Efficienza e Velocità</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Nessun overhead di agenzia. Comunicazione diretta, comprensione rapida del contesto e soluzioni mirate senza perdite di tempo.
            </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Come Funziona */}
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-12 font-heading text-glow">Come Funziona</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="flex gap-6 group">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-mint-500/10 text-mint-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold border border-mint-500/20 group-hover:bg-mint-500/20 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,255,163,0.3)] transition-all font-ui text-lg">1</div>
                <div class="pt-1">
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 font-heading group-hover:text-mint-400 transition-colors">Contatto Iniziale</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 font-sans">Lascia un contatto o scrivici una email brevemente descrivendo la tua sfida.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex gap-6 group">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-mint-500/10 text-mint-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold border border-mint-500/20 group-hover:bg-mint-500/20 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,255,163,0.3)] transition-all font-ui text-lg">2</div>
                <div class="pt-1">
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 font-heading group-hover:text-mint-400 transition-colors">Definizione Obiettivi</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 font-sans">Analizziamo la richiesta e definiamo insieme l'immagine del risultato atteso.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-6 group">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-mint-500/10 text-mint-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold border border-mint-500/20 group-hover:bg-mint-500/20 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,255,163,0.3)] transition-all font-ui text-lg">3</div>
                <div class="pt-1">
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 font-heading group-hover:text-mint-400 transition-colors">Lavoro e Risultato</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 font-sans">Lavoriamo insieme online per risolvere il problema. Pagamento flessibile (personale o aziendale).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-3 font-heading">Preferisci vedere casi pratici prima della call?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">Esplora il percorso completo con esempi reali di tracking, analisi e dashboard.</p>
        <a href="/course" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-white hover:border-mint-400/50 hover:text-mint-300 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/70 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#050505]">Vedi il percorso formativo</a>
      </section>
    </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>
